1
00:00:00,574 --> 00:00:04,454
Three hundred sixty-six.
Three hundred sixty-seven.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:05,950
(Amy:)How's it going?

3
00:00:06,163 --> 00:00:08,083
(Sheldon:)How's counting going?

4
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:09,670
(Sheldon:)When I was in kindergarten...

5
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:13,875
(Sheldon:)...I recited pi to a thousand places
for the school talent show.

6
00:00:14,088 --> 00:00:16,548
(Sheldon:)- I think I got this.
- Great.

7
00:00:21,929 --> 00:00:24,139
(Sheldon:)Aw, nuts.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,230
(Sheldon:)One.

9
00:00:29,979 --> 00:00:31,689
(Sheldon:)This is preposterous.

10
00:00:31,856 --> 00:00:34,316
(Sheldon:)You're giving me these tasks
because you're afraid...

11
00:00:34,525 --> 00:00:37,985
(Sheldon:)...if you give me anything meaningful
to do, I'll show you up.

12
00:00:40,239 --> 00:00:41,449
(Sheldon:)Yes, that's what I think.

13
00:00:45,536 --> 00:00:48,826
(Amy:)Hey, I've been training in the field
of neurobiology for 12 years.

14
00:00:49,039 --> 00:00:52,539
You've been here three hours and
you spent one of them in the bathroom.

15
00:00:52,751 --> 00:00:57,711
Well, I'm sorry, it takes me a while to get
things going on an unfamiliar toilet.

16
00:00:58,382 --> 00:01:02,342
(Amy:)I've given you the simplest things to do
and you haven't done one of them right.

